    "preamble": "V. Mahendra vs State Of Andhra Pradesh on 10 September, 2020 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No. 3784 of 2020 O R D E R:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed under Section 482 Cr.P.C. seeking to quash the proceedings in Crime No.118 of 2020 on the file of the Station House Officer, Kaligiri Police Station, SPSR Nellore District, against the petitioners for the offence punishable under Sections 328, 272, 273 IPC and Section 59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act. Learned counsel for the petitioners has placed reliance on the order dated 24.08.2020 passed in Criminal Petition No.3324 of 2020 by this Court.",
